Z||000017||Ken Wittlief||06-22-2001||01:46 PM||||Got a neat little pamphlet for my new saturn L200 in the mail - talks about the air bags - how they work"<P>  Turns out Kwrap is also the sound the bones in your neck make if you are not wearing a seatbelt in a car with airbags, and you are pushed forwards against the dash where the airbag is packed (hit from behind or driver nails the brakes) and then you hit something and the airbag goes off.<P>  Fatality rate for this sceanero is almost 100%. Sad thing is these are usually not serious accidents - its the airbag itself that kills you.||||reg||1
